abstract: "StableSpectralElements.jl is a Julia framework for the numerical solution of hyperbolic and mixed hyperbolic-parabolic conservation laws on general unstructured grids using provably stable discontinuous spectral-element methods with the summation-by-parts property."
keywords:
  - "conservation laws"
  - "spectral-element methods"
  - "summation-by-parts operators"
  - "discontinuous Galerkin methods"
  - "entropy stability"
  - "Julia"
